A||N||26||Tina||Back from the track for the first time...(pic's)||||6||
Z||000000||Tina||10-14-2001||07:15 PM||||Well made it home a little while ago from Rock Falls Raceway.<P>What a blast.....<BR>Altough driving in there for the first time, you could almost get a "Inferiority complex"!<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13871180&p=55226137"> <P>So many really nice cars, almost all guys of course  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>And so much to learn for newbie.<BR>(Soaked the info up like a sponge though,to bad their was no coffee to be soaked up as well. Really could of used that ...Brrrrrr) <P>Anyways...after running a 12.9 in the "Street Eliminator Class",  <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13871180&p=55226126"> <P>poor little silver was bumped up and had to run with the "Big Dogs"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13871180&p=55226130"> <P>Just a bunch of smoke,spinning tires,but NO hookup.........<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13871180&p=55226121"> <P>.........GAME OVER........<P>I gotta do this again<BR>Tina  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW Few more pic's here <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=13871180" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=13871180</A> <P><BR>||||reg||6
Z||000001||Standard||10-14-2001||07:33 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">12.9!!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> sweeeeeeeeeet!<P>mustgetv8mustgetv8mustgetv8mustgetv8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">         <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Raydar||10-14-2001||07:37 PM||||Inferiority complex?!<P>I'll bet that you gave a few people an inferiority complex of their very own.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>12.9! Way to go!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||14
Z||000003||Tina||10-14-2001||07:50 PM||||Oh it was ugly at first........<BR>yellow<BR>yellow<BR>Green<BR>1st......Alright off the line (Big exhale)<BR>2nd......I'am going to get you Ford.....<BR>5th...... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> ouch,%^&*%$$*<BR>Back into 3rd......revvvvvvvvvvvvvv<P>14.0 sec, when it was all done  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>||||reg||1
