Z||000025||lildevil||10-16-2001||07:17 PM||||Tina ,<P>Great times! I am WAY jealous.  I was wondering what kinda rims are on your car. Are they Eagles?  And what size? I have egales and the wheels on your car look the same but the center cap looks different. I want some 17's of the same style wheel but eagle doesn't make them. But if yours aren't eagles then maybe that company does make a 17 inch wheel in that style.  Did i loose you? <P><P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
